ame":"Sylvia Cooper","role":"segretaria"},{"id":1169381,"name":"Barbara De Nuntis","role":"Ostetrica","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8o7gMSqc7gCWOoCF0jDOE8TQmu8.jpg"},{"id":1754189,"name":"Laurel Levey","role":"invitata al matrimonio","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t77ZJQQ594p1W9LxpHEJT8yLx9W.jpg"},{"id":915692,"name":"Lisa Varga","role":"invitata al matrimonio","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wu5kNf7IC8TQapOvM3stIeHKnjb.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Barbara e Matteo sono italiani innamorati a Miami, dove gestiscono un ristorante e aspettano un bambino. Alla vigilia del lieto evento piombano nelle loro vite i rispettivi e ingombranti genitori, ansiosi di diventare nonni e di accogliere il nipotino. Massimo, padre di Matteo, gestisce un albergo a Cortina, vive nel ricordo della moglie perduta e ama in segreto la Luminosa direttrice dell'\"Ancora\". Angela, madre di Barbara, vive a New York, è proprietaria di una catena di ristoranti e felicemente separata da un marito siciliano. I preparativi fervono quando all'aeroporto Barbara è colta da doglie e condotta in ospedale per dare alla luce il suo bambino nero. Matteo avvilito e persuaso del tradimento di Barbara, scappa con una ex fiamma. Ci penserà mamma Angela a svelare l'arcano e la sua one night stand con Mr. Obama."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Barbara and Matteo are two Italians who live in Miami, managing a small restaurant overlooking the sea. Barbara is pregnant and the happy event brings their respective parents together in Miami: Massimo, Matteo's father, who has recently become a widower and has a hotel in Cortina, and Angela, Barbara's mother, who instead has a chain of restaurants and is separated from her husband. At first, the incompatibility between the two is sky-high. Then, while events, misunderstandings and plots of various kinds revolve around them, the ice slowly begins to break and affinities emerge when the two find themselves busy restoring peace between their children, who have entered into a crisis due to the birth of the little girl."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muQ2ja86OEnKhClb4Ji6WfNL451.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/muQ2ja86OEnKhClb4Ji6WfNL451.png","language":"it","width":505,"height":219}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/24N06F9a7ad00yLIyso7W9L5LU2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/24N06F9a7ad00yLIyso7W9L5LU2.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7pMu48WsbIEUzhGShHwKzgVgcTX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7pMu48WsbIEUzhGShHwKzgVgcTX.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":895}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o1bEmtFZxB3s34sPKFZQlBdZ6ZX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o1bEmtFZxB3s34sPKFZQlBdZ6ZX.jpg","language":"it","width":1421,"height":800},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/182uZKo5cCoUBaBXryyN33Im5rV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/182uZKo5cCoUBaBXryyN33Im5rV.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720}]},"logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muQ2ja86OEnKhClb4Ji6WfNL451.png","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/24N06F9a7ad00yLIyso7W9L5LU2.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o1bEmtFZxB3s34sPKFZQlBdZ6ZX.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":52213,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/24N06F9a7ad00yLIyso7W9L5LU2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/24N06F9a7ad00yLIyso7W9L5LU2.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https